            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩkilĩlye, Mwĩaĩi Yeova e vo; nũndũ mũthenya wa Yeova nũthengeee: nũndũ Yeova nũseũvĩtye nthembo, nũvathĩte aeni make. ",
