          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũthenya ũsu, easya ũu Yeova, kũkeethĩwa kĩlonzo kya kũkaya mbingĩlonĩ ya makũyũ, na kĩĩo kuma ũtũinĩ wa kelĩ, na kĩtuu kĩnene kuma iĩmanĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
